{
    "chapter_num": 54,
    "verses_count": 7,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Prayer for Vindication"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "To the choirmaster: with stringed instruments. A Maskil of David, when the Ziphites went and told Saul, “David is in hiding among us.”"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Save me, O God, by thy name,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and vindicate me by thy might."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Hear my prayer, O God;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "\tgive ear to the words of my mouth."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For insolent men"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Another reading is strangers"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " have risen against me,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "\truthless men seek my life;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "\tthey do not set God before them.Selah"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Behold, God is my helper;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "\tthe Lord is the upholder of my life."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He will requite my enemies with evil;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "\tin thy faithfulness put an end to them."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "With a freewill offering I will sacrifice to thee;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "\tI will give thanks to thy name, O Lord, for it is good."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For thou hast delivered me from every trouble,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "\tand my eye has looked in triumph on my enemies."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}